  "methods": [
    "Exact stored compiled convex brush planes represented as rational values; zero collision epsilon for static full-hull queries.",
    "Manhunt horizontal cap-vs-bottom-rectangle SAT contact intervals are unioned over every whole segment, independently of full translated-hull clearance.",
    "Wet route starts from conservative support proposals, adds actual support-boundary knots, then verifies exact poses and whole sweeps. Same convex contact at endpoints certifies continuous support; bounded step pairs separately prove clear raise/translate legs and supported endpoints.",
    "Water membership samples strict plane interiors and flags boundaries; it does not execute PM_CategorizePosition or state integration.",
    "Upward point hits are matched to actual sky-flagged draw faces; upward full-hull sweeps separately check room to surface.",
    "Analytical plans show selected upward rendered surfaces, sky omitted, in height slabs; trim and overlapping surfaces can remain and are not automatically playable floors."
  ],
